# `packages/private/web-core` is a React package consumed only by `apps/*`, which this image never builds.
# Without this line `COPY packages ./packages` would bring it in, turbo would find it as a workspace, and
# `yarn turbo run build` would typecheck it against a node_modules where React was never installed -- the
# manifests copied above deliberately omit it. Same category as `apps/website`, which is in yarn.lock but
# has never been copied into this image either.
packages/private/web-core
